### List all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Search by partial title
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search_q=the

### Sort and paginate
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=price&order=DESC&limit=2&offset=0

### Filter by price range
GET http://localhost:3000/books?min_price=250&max_price=400

### Create a book (expected 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hobbit",
  "author": "J. R. R. Tolkien",
  "price": 350
}

### Invalid create: missing title (expected 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Unknown Author",
  "price": 200
}

### Invalid create: non-numeric price (expected 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad Price",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "price": "not-a-number"
}

### Get book 1 (expected 200 if it exists)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1

### Get missing book (expected 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/99999

### Update book 1 (expected 200 if it exists)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Book",
  "author": "Updated Author",
  "price": 275
}

### Delete book 1 (expected 200 if it exists)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/1

### Delete missing book (expected 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/99999
